{
  "label": "cafe15",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label cafe15:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafe_day",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/cafe_day.png",
      "alt": "cafe_day"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Next customer, please!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafe1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafe1.webp",
      "alt": "cafe1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh hey, Sensei. What’s up?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Morning, Rin. Just stopping by to play my weekly game of coffee-roulette.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafe4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafe4.webp",
      "alt": "cafe4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, you’re in luck because I’m actually about to clock out.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Already? Are you getting your hours cut or something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafe6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafe6.webp",
      "alt": "cafe6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh? No, it’s nothing like that.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Haruka would never cut my hours. I’m too good at this stuff.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So good that I have two shifts, actually. I just need to clock out between them for a doctor's appointment.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafe4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafe4.webp",
      "alt": "cafe4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But, hey! Drop by again later and you can get all the Rin you want!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A doctor’s appointment? Is something wrong?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafe3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafe3.webp",
      "alt": "cafe3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, nah. It's no big deal. Just some...check-up sorta thing. You don’t need to worry about it.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I'm not going to try and get involved where I'm not welcome. Hope it goes well, though.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafe4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafe4.webp",
      "alt": "cafe4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm sure it will!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, what can I get for you today, sir?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I appreciate that you still ask even though we both know you aren’t going to listen.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just doing my job, Sensei!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Are you really, though?...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I choose a random drink off of the menu and prepare myself for whatever it is Rin will be making for me today.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Considering that her last drink wasn't as solid as the preceding ones, I'm thinking that this time-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Done!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux1.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? Already? But I haven't even sat down yet.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yup! Here ya go! One cafe mocha!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like...a normal cafe mocha? With nothing weird about it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you just have one left over from another customer or something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nope. Just the greatest barista in the world working extra hard to deliver quality beverages to her favorite teacher.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...What?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you dying or something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux2.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? Of course not. I told you it was just a check-up.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then why are you giving me a normal drink? Have I done something to offend you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux3.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No...it's not like that. I just wasn't really feeling creative today.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But if you really want, I can go dump a bunch of stuff into a cup and see how that comes out instead. Just didn't wanna give you something I couldn't put my heart into, you know?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't think that's necessary. I'm just a little surprised to see you going through such a slump.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux4.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A...slump?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe that's not the right word for it. You've just seemed a little out of sorts lately.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Out of sorts?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Besides, I thought you loved making weird drinks and laughing silently to yourself as I test them before anyone else.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux5.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I do, though. Just not today, okay?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know you can talk to me if-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Didn't I like, just tell you the other day that I was fine? You don’t have to worry about me, Sensei. Really.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not just me, though. Chika is worrying about you too.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux6.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait...what? Chika is...worrying about me? Are you sure? What if she was talking about another Rin?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I really don't think she was.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But why? Like, how does she even know something is wrong?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I thought nothing was wrong?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, that. That's what I meant to say. Why does she think that something is wrong?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because you keep getting all weird around her.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She's noticed that you haven't been acting like yourself and seems to think it might be her fault.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She thinks...it's her fault?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s not the case though, is it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course that's not the case. It's just...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux7.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I decide to let Rin stay quiet for a little while as she figures out the best way to talk about this.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "When she remains quiet for an uncomfortable amount of time, though, I decide it might be best to provide a little positive reinforcement...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Take your time, Rin.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not going anywhere anytime soon. So if you-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux8.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei, do you ever have any thoughts that you wish you didn’t?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean exactly?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know. Like, stuff that pops into your head that you realize shouldn’t be there but, like...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can’t really do anything about it.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if roomwithtrack == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene newroom1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/newroom1.webp",
      "alt": "newroom1"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene newroom9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/newroom9.webp",
      "alt": "newroom9"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene newroom17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/newroom17.webp",
      "alt": "newroom17"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene newroom8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/newroom8.webp",
      "alt": "newroom8"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux8.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess I do sometimes.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whygodwhy",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/whygodwhy.png",
      "alt": "whygodwhy"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux8.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe every now and then, sure.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, not good. But I’m at least glad that I’m not the only one it happens to.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you want to talk about what you’re-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not really. But thanks.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux1.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know what? Why don't we just talk about something else?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene happy1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/happy1.png",
      "alt": "happy1"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene happy2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/happy2.png",
      "alt": "happy2"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene happy3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/happy3.png",
      "alt": "happy3"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux9.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like the inevitable collapse of our relationship when you start fucking the girl I habitually touch myself to.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or the ever present, looming darkness bubbling up inside of us. Expanding in size until it's brave enough to crawl through our throats.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Frothing like the foam atop a cafe mocha.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A window of the waking mind, thick with saliva and the remnants of days gone by.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why don't we talk about that?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or better yet-",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux10.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": why dont we talk about nothing",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene colorbars",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/colorbars.png",
      "alt": "colorbars"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene happy1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/happy1.png",
      "alt": "happy1"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene happy2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/happy2.png",
      "alt": "happy2"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene happy3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/happy3.png",
      "alt": "happy3"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene cafemocharedux11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/cafemocharedux11.webp",
      "alt": "cafemocharedux11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "//////////////////TERMINAL 23 IS EXPERIENCING A DISRUPTION IN SERVICE",
      "zh": ""
